cant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEDA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEUCHI, KIYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOJIMA, JUNJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO, KOICHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IKEDA TAKASHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IKEUCHI KIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOJIMA JUNJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO KOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEDA, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEUCHI, KIYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOJIMA, JUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORIMOTO, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for manufacturing a chip PTC thermister comprises thermoforming a piece of conductive polymer having PTC characteristics and metal foils formed by patterning and provided on the upper and lower sides of the piece under pressure integrally into a sheet, making a hole part in the sheet, applying protective coat serving also as plating resist to upper and lower sides of the sheet, forming an electrode on the sheet by electroplating, and cutting the sheet into a chip. The protective coat is made of a material applicable at a temperature equal to or lower than the melting point of the conductive polymer. The processing temperatures at the steps from the step of making a hole part in the sheet to the pre-processing step of the step of forming an electrode by electroplating on the sheet are not above the melting point of the conductive polymer.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un procédé de fabrication de puces PTC (thermistance à coefficient de température positif) consistant à thermoformer une pièce de polymère thermoconducteur aux caractéristiques de PTC et former par transfert de motifs des feuilles métalliques disposées sous pression sur les faces supérieure et inférieure d'une pièce de manière à former une feuille, puis à percer un trou dans la feuille puis à appliquer une couche protectrice servant également de réserve de plaquage sur les faces supérieure et inférieure de la feuille, puis à constituer une électrode par galvanoplastie, puis à découper la feuille en puces. La couche protectrice est faite d'un matériau s'appliquant à une température égale ou inférieure au point de fusion du polymère conducteur. Les températures de traitement pour les étapes allant du percement du trou jusqu'à l'étape de prétraitement précédant la formation de l'électrode par galvanoplastie ne dépassent pas celle du point de fusion du polymère conducteur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>